  "relation": "Linear forest: GTBase.path_trees.linear_forest G := is_forest [set: G] /\\ Delta G <= 2 on any sgraph, a forest whose vertices have at most two neighbours (a disjoint union of paths), with no connectedness, nonemptiness or size guard; the empty and edgeless graphs qualify. The three supplied-colour-class predicates xNN_linear_forest_colour col i of X34, X212 and X23 are linear_forest (xNN_colour_graph col i) by conversion, over D12's live spanning colour class (host carrier kept, total {set G} -> 'I_q colouring). path_tree G <-> linear_forest G /\\ connected [set: G]: the connected path tree stays distinct.",
