  "summary": [
    "D14 (first three-row stage of the linear-forest owner) adds the canonical GTBase.path_trees.linear_forest G := is_forest [set: G] /\\ Delta G <= 2 to the existing path_trees module (path_tree unchanged) with its degree form, projections and introduction, the path-tree relationship path_treeP (path_tree G <-> linear_forest G /\\ connected [set: G]), the edgeless/empty corner, K0/K1/K2 positives and triangle/claw negatives; the public client adds an unused colour class, which keeps the whole host carrier and has no edge.",
    "X34, X212 and X23 xNN_linear_forest_colour col i are now GTBase.path_trees.linear_forest (xNN_colour_graph col i) through a qualified Require GTBase.path_trees (no Import); headers and implicit arguments unchanged; the alias keeps D12's live colour class.",
    "Frozen at the D14 baseline A28P 1123673d (byte-identical to the discovery pin e2a6bf47) in <area>/theories/migration/linear_forest.v: the three sources, the five chains (X34 linear_forests_and_matching; X212 and X23 linear_arboricity_at_most and linear_arboricity) and the three current rows, all certified by kernel-checked conversion.",
    "Six whole iff: the three current rows (this family) and the three complete D12 rows borrowed with their exact D12 descriptors and certificates: X34Original over M1's raw edge set at 061154c, X212Legacy and X23Legacy at 2f37b10a. Every guard is kept: the total colouring and the impossibility of q = 0 (even on the empty host), the attained and universal minimum, X34's same colouring with the widen_ord / ord_max split, its matching clause and the documented 9-vs-7 threshold defect, and X212's documented k = 0 / edgeless divergence; nothing is repaired.",
    "D12/M1 certificates and raw bodies are unchanged. Later classes of this owner, not migrated here: the Digraph path_fas.linear_forest and GTMisc X74 x74_induced_linear_forest degree forms (equivalent through Delta_le2P).",
    "Source repair (2026-10-24, X34 re-audit; record meta/STATEMENT_IMPROVEMENTS.md, X34 entry), not a migration equivalence: the live X34 row's guard 9 <= Delta G became the source's 7 <= Delta G, a strengthening. The frozen X34Legacy row keeps the D14 text verbatim; its statement entry and the borrowed D12 original-statement entry carry the identical repair (one exact text replacement, the pinned doc block, the record), and both certificates are kernel-checked as live -> frozen (the converse is the open case Delta = 7)."
  ],
